# Build artifacts for the forge2 code__code-invalid__coupler package (ticket #397). Any
# install regenerates these, so they are never committed and are never hand-written.
#
# coupler.egg-info/ matters more here than it does for most packages: importlib.metadata
# reads *.egg-info straight off sys.path, so a committed one would make
# version("coupler") resolve to the pyproject version for anyone with this directory on
# their path, whether or not the distribution is installed — silently hiding the unit's
# fallback path. `pip install -e .` writes it here; leave it uncommitted.
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The default bug_reports path from registry.json (see note-for-claude). Runtime output.
logs/
